# Build artifacts — generated by `pnpm build` in this package.
# Committed intentionally: downstream packages (admin-ui) consume
# the built dist at dev time without a separate CI build step.
# When CI is added, move dist here and add a `build` step in pipeline.
#
# If you change src/, run `pnpm --filter @mercflow/design-tokens build`
# before committing so the dist stays in sync.
